      "note": [
        "Please state The Swedish Agency for Economic and Regional Growth and Statistics Sweden as source when publishing information.",
        "In 1994, 150 facilities, mainly conference facilities, were added to the Hotels category as a basis for the statistics. \r\n As from 2002, all hostels are reported under the Hostels category. Facilities not associated with the Swedish Tourist Association were previously included in the Hotels category.",
        "The table contains data on the year’s average available beds per day and the total number of overnight stays at all hotels, holiday villages, and youth hostels, by region. To facilitate comparison over time, the statistics are reported by current regional division 2007-01-01.",
        "As of 4 February 2022 the accommodation statistics will be published on the Swedish Agency for Economic and Regional Growths website: \r\n  \r\n[Tillväxtverket—inkvarteringsstatistik](http://www.tillvaxtverket.se/statistik/turism/inkvarteringsstatistik)"
